Search (Redis cache hit):           ~5ms
Search (client cache hit):           ~0ms
AI Playlist (100 songs):           ~18s   (streamed, first results at ~3s)
SoulLink room creation:            ~120ms
Page load (Vercel edge):           ~800ms
APK cold start:                    ~1.2s
&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;

&lt;/div&gt;






